 1→//! WinFsp FileSystemContext implementation for CipherBoxFS.
 2→//!
 3→//! Translates all macOS FUSE callbacks to their WinFsp equivalents.
 4→//! Uses `Arc<Mutex<CipherBoxFS>>` for interior mutability (WinFsp callbacks
 5→//! receive `&self`, not `&mut self`, because the driver invokes callbacks on
 6→//! any thread).
